WEBVTT

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:30.416
And he has his eureka moment.

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:35.976
In a flash, he realizes how species
could emerge and evolve slowly,

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:39.056
through this process
of the survival of the fittest.

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:41.376
It all comes to him,
he writes it all down,

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:45.136
every single important element
of the theory of evolution,

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:46.896
in that notebook.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:50.736
But then, a new project.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:52.360
His son William is born.

00:13:53.200 --> 00:13:55.896
Well, there's a natural
experiment right there,

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:58.496
you get to observe
the development of a human infant.

00:13:58.520 --> 00:14:01.216
So immediately,
Darwin starts making notes.